#: interfaces/kimproxy/interface/kcm_instantmessenger.desktop:51
msgid ""
"Comment=The instant messenger allows two-way chat between individuals and "
"groups."
msgstr ""
"Comment=កម្មវិធី​ជជែក​កំសាន្ត​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​ជជែក​តាម​របៀប​ពីរ​បែប​រវាង​បុគ្គល "
"និង ក្រុម ។"

#: interfaces/kscript/sample/shellscript.desktop:3
